{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And You said, I will surely deal well with you.</b> If this happens, it will be the opposite of what You promised — to deal well with me — should I see the destruction of my family." "<b>And I will make your seed.</b> This too will turn out the opposite, should my seed be cut off. It is fitting that You act for the sake of the honor of Your name, to fulfill Your promise, even though I am unworthy of it — as it says: אִם עֲוֹנֵינוּ עָנוּ בָנוּ ה' עֲשֵׂה לְמַעַן שְׁמֶךָ (Jeremiah 14:7)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:58.968850959Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}